<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round-robin group matches on the second day of the ATP Tour world championship on Wednesday (prefix number denotes world ranking):</p>
<p>White Group</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)  6-4 6-3  </p>
<p>Red group</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S) beat 7-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>White group</p>
<p>4-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 8-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 6-4 6-7 (4-7) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
</text>
